  "description": "[Configuration] / [Bean] / [Value] / [ConfigurationProperties] / [Profile] for AutoRegisterDependency. Binds configuration sections to typed objects and injects them directly — a drop-in replacement for services.Configure<T>() + IOptions<T>, with the binding path declared on the class itself. These types ship as a separate package from Core; their namespaces and source code are unchanged. The only package in the family that depends on the configuration stack.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
